  vendorName: Clerk Clayton
  offerText: I offer a premium archiving service. Pay my fee, and I will take your
    towering stacks of paper documents, digitize them, and destroy the physical copies
    to clear your room.
  acceptResultText: Clayton shreds the mountains of paper. Your desk is finally visible
    again, and the room feels incredibly spacious.
  rejectResultText: You decide to organize the papers yourself.
  acceptedDelayedText: You try to access the digital files. The drive is completely
    empty. Clayton destroyed all your vital records and vanished, sending you into
    a panic.
  rejectedDelayedText: While sorting the heavy stacks, you actually find a forgotten
    stash of emergency cash!
